# Entities

## Framework semantics

Entities hold record state, accessibility, accessors/mutators, and virtual properties. They are not Active Record models by default.

## Required behavior

- Keep `_accessible` tight; patch with explicit fields when needed.
- Use accessors/virtual fields for derived values from loaded data.
- Do not issue queries from entities by default.

## Anti-patterns

- Active Record entity
- Mass assignment overexposure

## Review checklist

- [ ] Accessibility justified
- [ ] No hidden queries in accessors unless intentionally documented